{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"71.202.225.11","IsFirstPost":true,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":true,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79055,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":1428870780,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":3,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"8d1675cfdd33ddd2a488dfe47603a1d3","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;We have released a new mobile app for BDW.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;It is free and available for iOS by searching &#039;Best Destination Wedding&#039; in iTunes, and for Android via Google play here:&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;https:\/\/play.google.com\/store\/apps\/details?id=headstandconsulting.BDWMobile&#039;&gt;https:\/\/play.google.com\/store\/apps\/details?id=headstandconsulting.BDWMobile&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Currently it only provides access to the Forum, Profile, and PMs, but we plan to add Blogs, Gallery, and Reviews in future releases.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Please check it out and post your feedback for how we can make it better here in this thread.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Thank you in advance for all of your suggestions.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1892880,"PostDate":1428870631,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>We have released a new mobile app for BDW.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>It is free and available for iOS by searching 'Best Destination Wedding' in iTunes, and for Android via Google play here:<\/p>\n<p><a href='https:\/\/play.google.com\/store\/apps\/details?id=headstandconsulting.BDWMobile' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>https:\/\/play.google....lting.BDWMobile<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Currently it only provides access to the Forum, Profile, and PMs, but we plan to add Blogs, Gallery, and Reviews in future releases.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Please check it out and post your feedback for how we can make it better here in this thread.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Thank you in advance for all of your suggestions.<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"steve@bestdestinationwedding.com","IpAddress":"71.202.225.11","GroupId":4,"GroupName":"Administrators","JoinDate":1159056600,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-206829.jpg?_r=1386354305","PhotoWidth":344,"PhotoHeight":339,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"SteveW","Id":206829,"Name":"SteveW","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"64.231.97.33","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":true,"CanDelete":true,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79055,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":2,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"2d548811e01e1d3849736cd92db41a4b","RawContent":"Just downloaded.  looks good so far","Attachments":[],"Id":1892883,"PostDate":1428873045,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Just downloaded.  looks good so far